      'People convert MOV to MP3 to keep a concert clip as a song, to send a recorded talk to someone who only wants the audio, or to feed a transcription service. Those are personal recordings, often long ones. Instead of uploading a gigabyte of 4K video to keep a few megabytes of sound, this page decodes the audio track in your browser and writes the MP3 with the LAME encoder running in the page.',
